  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As can be seen from the diagram, the initial phase&nbsp;of the particle is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#966;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The equation of motion of the particle at its initial position at time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the angular displacement of the particle at time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p><p>Since, the position of the particle at a later instant of time always lags behind its initial position at time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the equation of motion of the particle at any instant of time&nbsp;is given by</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (2) to obtain the required expression</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
